# 统一行尾：仓库内一律 LF，检出时按各平台自动转换
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保持 CRLF，避免 cmd/PowerShell 执行异常
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源，禁止 Git 做任何转换或 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.glb binary
